  negative_control: "Remove omitProducerDiagnostics from beforeSend in src/core/sentry/instrument.ts: the instrument.spec.ts case finds the diagnostics marker in the outgoing event; remove the details projection from errorContent in src/mcp/server.ts: the MCP oversize case receives the 5,000-byte payload"
